# Welcome to the chatbot!

This is a **live demo**. Type a message below to see how Markup+ renders responses.

@tip
Try asking about code, tables, or lists.
@end

## What I can do

- Render **rich** text
- Display `code` inline
- Show tables
- Create alerts
- Format lists

@note
This is a static demo. In a real chatbot, responses come from an LLM.
@end